{% doc %}
  A status chosen by an agent (status menu, reply's "then", bulk edit, board
  column). Spam goes through mark_spam (D-27), so choosing Spam anywhere also
  blocks the sender, as the "Mark as spam" button does; every other status
  goes to change_status. Returns { valid, errors, ticket }.
  @param {object} ticket - Ticket loaded through queries/tickets/find
  @param {string} status_key - Target status key
  @param {object} actor - { type, id, member }
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  if status_key == 'spam'
    function result = 'modules/support/commands/tickets/mark_spam', ticket: ticket, actor: actor
  else
    function result = 'modules/support/commands/tickets/change_status', ticket: ticket, status_key: status_key, actor: actor
  endif
  return result
%}
